DESCRIPTION:AI/IA CDMX (Ciudad de México Inteligencia Artificial)\nEvent
  live streams on youtube.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@AICDMX\n\nFollow us\nh
 ttps://www.instagram.com/cdmxai/\nhttps://www.facebook.com/aicdmx\nhttps:/
 /www.linkedin.com/company/ai-cdmx\n\nJoin us and stay ahead of the curve. 
 You won’t just learn about AI—you’ll learn how to use it to your adv
 antage.\nThis event is just a glimpse into these topics. Our group dives i
 nto AI from all angles with monthly events and workshops that explore a wi
 de range of themes.
